2.3. šag₄-bi-ta |U×KASKAL|-|U×KASKAL|-|U×KASKAL|{iku}-am₃
#lem: šag[heart]; U@g[unit of area]
#tr.en: Of this, 
#etcsl: line-id=2.3

2.4. šukur₂ lu₂ niŋ₂-PAD-e-ne
#lem: šukur[food allocation]; lu[person]; niŋdab[requisitions]
#tr.en: three @fsux{BURgunû} (i.e. 540 @fsux{iku}) are the  
#etcsl: line-id=2.4

2.5. sahar 2(aš) iku-ba me-a
#lem: sahar[soil]; n; iku[unit of area]; me[be]
#tr.en: portion of the men in charge of the requisitions. 
#etcsl: line-id=2.5

